-- ---- s 497: auditable part of the directors' remuneration report
#ASSERT `s 497(1) the auditor must report on the auditable part of the directors' remuneration report` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 497(1) the auditor must report on the auditable part of the directors' remuneration report` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
